Krea 2 ReDiverse is a Derivative of Krea 2 and has been modified from the Krea Model: it is a LoRA adapter for
krea/Krea-2-Turbo (with inference code), trained by regressing Krea 2 Turbo's activations onto those of krea/Krea-2-Raw
(ReDiverse, arXiv:2611.18550). It is not an official Krea product and is not endorsed by Krea.
